{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08824","headline":"茔禅师房观山海图 · 李白","name":"茔禅师房观山海图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真僧闭精宇，灭迹含达观。\n列嶂图云山，攒峰入霄汉。\n丹崖森在目，清昼疑卷幔。\n蓬壶来轩窗，瀛海入几案。\n烟涛争喷薄，岛屿相凌乱。\n征帆飘空中，瀑水洒天半。\n峥嵘若可陟，想像徒盈叹。\n杳与真心冥，遂谐静者翫。\n如登赤城里，揭步沧洲畔。\n即事能娱人，从兹得消散。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}